-- 01 is the sender whose inbox is under test. Every other account is an
-- ordinary member; nothing here says what kind of member any of them is.
SELECT id,'10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001' FROM social_conversations;
-- 1: two welcomes from the sender (agent welcome, then owner follow-up), no reply.
-- 2: a welcome from the sender, and the member replied.
-- 3: a welcome from the sender, and the sender wrote a message of their own.
-- 4: the sender is the RECIPIENT of somebody else's welcome.
-- 5: an ordinary message from the sender, with no metadata at all.
-- 6: the sender's only message is a cashier cash-out receipt (a listed accounting type).
-- 7: the only message is an invoice type the inbox never lists.
-- 8: a group whose only message is the sender's welcome-flagged message.
-- 9: the sender's only message carries club_welcome false.
